WEBVTT

00:07:30.779 --> 00:07:35.743
So I thought, hey, maybe,
maybe we can value their services to.

00:07:36.702 --> 00:07:39.330
Right? Same thing.

00:07:39.371 --> 00:07:43.209
But again, use the same
model of valuation.

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:45.503
You follow the same methodology,

00:07:45.544 --> 00:07:47.630
and you discount all of that
to the present.

00:07:47.630 --> 00:07:50.341
And you ask yourself, what is the value

00:07:50.382 --> 00:07:54.136
of a single elephant's
carbon sequestration service?

00:07:54.970 --> 00:07:56.555
Would you like to know how much?

00:07:56.597 --> 00:07:57.848
Audience: Yes!

00:07:57.890 --> 00:07:59.350
RC: Here we go.

00:07:59.391 --> 00:08:01.810
2.6 million dollars.